            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-57585-python3-pip-whl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-57585 medium vulnerability for python3-pip-whl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "MessagePack is the serializer implementation for Python msgpack.org. Prior to 1.2.1, there is an Out-of-bounds read/crash on Unpacker reuse after a caught error, potentially leading to a DoS attack.  If the Unpacker is used repeatedly after an error occurs, the process may crash with a SEGV. This issue has been fixed in version 1.2.1."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-57585",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-57585\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: python3-pip-whl\nVersion: 24.0+dfsg-1ubuntu1.3\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/info/python3-pip-whl.list\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-57585](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-57585)",
