              "id": "CVE-2026-76956-libexpat1",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-76956 medium vulnerability for libexpat1 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In libexpat 2.8.2 and 2.8.3 before 2.8.4, misinterpretation of getentropy's return code leads to insufficient entropy, which results in being vulnerable to hash flooding attacks, causing a denial of service via crafted XML content."
